BT 1 0 0 1 0 112.4 Tm /F3 7.6 Tf 10 TL (def install_airfoil\(src, name=None, store=None\):) Tj T* (    """Copy a .dat profile into the internal airfoil store under a chosen name.) Tj T*  T* (    Returns \(store_name, path_to_dat\). The profile then appears in every airfoil) Tj T* (    combo of the GUI without you having to manage where files live.""") Tj T* (    store = store or AIRFOIL_STORE) Tj T* (    os.makedirs\(store, exist_ok=True\)) Tj T* (    base = os.path.splitext\(os.path.basename\(src or ""\)\)[0]) Tj T* (    name = re.sub\(r"[^A-Za-z0-9 _\\\\-]", "", \(name or base\).strip\(\)\).strip\(\) or "airfoil") Tj T* (    dst = os.path.join\(store, name + ".dat"\)) Tj T* (    shutil.copy\(src, dst\)) Tj T* (    return name, dst) Tj T* ET
